# Deny by default: the login checkout is a developer's working tree and holds
# a real backend/.env, backups of it, .git and local scratch. `COPY . .` would
# put them into an image layer, where a later `rm` hides them but does not
# remove them from the image history. Name only what the service runs.
# (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile, even though
# the build context is the login checkout.)
**

!.htaccess
!frontend
!backend/.htaccess
!backend/index.php
!backend/composer.json
!backend/composer.lock
!backend/config
!backend/src
!backend/schema
# Operator CLI (mint-app-key.php, import-users.php) for `docker exec`; Apache
# refuses HTTP access to it (docker/web/apache-corporate.conf).
!backend/scripts

# Secrets and scratch inside the allowed trees.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
**/.superpowers
